    {
      "type": "text", "id": "ann_step3", "x": 400, "y": 550, "width": 340, "height": 90,
      "text": "wolverine schema in the SAME database as the entity. Auto-created at startup by AddResourceSetupOnStartup().\n\nKEY INVARIANT: entity row and envelope row are in ONE transaction. Either both commit or neither does.",
